    },
    {
      "title": "2. Explore",
      "text": "%md\n## 2. Explore the data\n\nFor the exploration I look at the same window the features use: IM4 and IM7, the 24 months before the snapshot.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
