    {
      "title": "E06 Top-up flag Y, but the tax did not go up",
      "text": "%md\n### E06: Top-up flag Y, but the tax did not go up\n\n**What it is.** The top-up flag is Y, but the final tax is not above the original tax.\n\n**What the model does.** Rule R7: a top-up counts only when the flag is Y **and** the final tax is above the\noriginal tax.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
