    {
      "title": "E08 Original tax is blank",
      "text": "%md\n### E08: Original tax is blank\n\n**What it is.** The original tax is blank on many declarations (about 37% of those without a top-up, in our\nearlier check). Section 2.2 shows it is rarely blank when there is a top-up.\n\n**What the model does.** Blank is read as \"unchanged\": the final tax is used. This is our reading, not stated in\nthe data. Big problem, so the table keeps a random 1 in 50 of the entries.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
