    {
      "title": "E09 top_up_amt holds the final tax, not the top-up",
      "text": "%md\n### E09: top_up_amt holds the final tax, not the top-up\n\n**What it is.** On declarations without a top-up, the `top_up_amt` column usually equals the final tax (99.5% of\nthe time in our earlier check), so it is not a top-up amount.\n\n**What the model does.** `top_up_amt` is not used. Top-up = final tax minus original tax. The table keeps a random\n1 in 50 of the entries.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
