    {
      "title": "E11 Value or weight zero, negative or blank",
      "text": "%md\n### E11: Value or weight zero, negative or blank\n\n**What it is.** A few items have no customs value or no weight, so a price per kg cannot be worked out.\n\n**What the model does.** Rule R8: such items are left out of the price features. They still count in their\ndeclaration.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
