    },
    {
      "title": "E12 Price per kg under 1% of other importers",
      "text": "%md\n### E12: Price per kg under 1% of other importers\n\n**What it is.** Some items are priced at under 1% of the middle price other importers declare for the same HS code.\nMost likely a weight or quantity typed in the wrong unit.\n\n**What the model does.** Rule R9: these are treated as keying errors, counted separately\n(`price_keying_error_per_item_24m_rate`) and kept out of the undervaluation measure.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
