    {
      "title": "E13 One TIN with several taxpayer names",
      "text": "%md\n### E13: One TIN with several taxpayer names\n\n**What it is.** Names are typed with variations (addresses mixed in, stray characters), so some TINs carry three or\nmore names.\n\n**What the model does.** Names are not used; the TIN identifies the taxpayer. The officers are asked to confirm\nnone of these TINs is shared by different businesses.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
