      "text": "%pyspark\nsummary = pd.DataFrame([[code] + list(problems[code]) for code in sorted(problems)],\n                       columns=['issue', 'title', 'entries_or_taxpayers', 'rows', 'sample_1_in'])\nsave_table(summary, 'ctrp_eda_summary')\nprint(summary.to_string(index=False))",
