    {
      "title": "4. Clean",
      "text": "%md\n## 4. Clean the data\n\nOne rule at a time, printing how many rows each one removes. A blank answer to a rule counts as a fail (for\nexample a blank status is removed with the cancelled ones).",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
