      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "7. Track B",
      "text": "%md\n## 7. Track B features (behaviour)\n\nNo input that records what customs did (no top-ups, no lanes). Three come from Track A: amended (6.3), shortfall\n(6.8), station (6.7).",
      "user": "anonymous",
