      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "8. After the features",
      "text": "%md\n## 8. Recency, small numbers, peer groups\n\n1. **Recency (Track A):** over 3 years, a declaration counts 1 in the latest year, 0.5 the year before, 0.25 the year\n   before that.\n2. **Small numbers (both tracks):** rate pulled towards everyone's average by weight n / (n + 10), only ever down.\n3. **Peer groups (Track B):** each feature becomes a percentile among importers with the same main goods and size.",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": true,
          "completionSupport": false
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": false,
        "editorHide": true,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "apps": [],
      "runtimeInfos": {},
      "progressUpdateIntervalMs": 500,
      "jobName": "paragraph_ctrp_mine_069",
      "id": "paragraph_ctrp_mine_069",
      "dateCreated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "status": "READY"
    },
    {
      "title": "8.1 Recency",
      "text": "%pyspark\nyear_weight = F.when(F.col('adate') > F.add_months(snap_date, -12), 1.0)\nyear_weight = year_weight.when(F.col('adate') > F.add_months(snap_date, -24), 0.5).otherwise(0.25)\nd3 = decl.filter(F.col('dt') <= SNAP).withColumn('w', year_weight)\nw = F.col('w')\nrecency = d3.groupBy('taxpayer_tin').agg(\n    (F.sum(w * F.col('topped_up')) / F.sum(w)).alias('topped_up_per_decl_3y_rate'),\n    (F.sum(w * F.col('severe')) / F.sum(w)).alias('severe_top_up_per_decl_3y_rate'),\n    (F.sum(w * F.when(F.col('amended') == 'Y', 1).otherwise(0)) / F.sum(w)).alias('amended_per_decl_3y_rate'),\n    (F.sum(w * F.col('negative_top_up')) / F.sum(w)).alias('tax_reduced_per_decl_3y_rate'),\n    F.sum(w * F.col('top_up')).alias('w_top_up'),\n    F.sum(w * F.col('orig_tax')).alias('w_orig_tax'))\nw_final_tax = F.col('w_orig_tax') + F.col('w_top_up')\nrecency = recency.withColumn('top_up_per_final_tax_3y_rate', F.when(w_final_tax > 0, F.col('w_top_up') / w_final_tax))\nrecency = recency.drop('w_top_up', 'w_orig_tax')\nrecency.show(5)",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "python",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionSupport": true
        },
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/python",
        "colWidth": 12.0,
        "fontSize": 9.0,
        "title": true,
        "editorHide": false,
        "results": {},
        "enabled": true
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
